# T-974: Unit constructor qualified access (T-1086: [type ...] evaluates to constructor dict).
# After T-1086, [type ...] evaluates to a dict {CtorName: Variant(TypeName.CtorName, Null)}.
# Constructors are accessed via dot-access: Transport.Tcp, Transport.Udp.
# The variant tag is qualified as "TypeName.CtorName" for keyed type declarations.
[
  Transport: [type Tcp Udp]
  tcp-val:   Transport.Tcp
  udp-val:   Transport.Udp
]
=== out
Dict({"Transport": Dict({"Tcp": Variant(Transport.Tcp, Null), "Udp": Variant(Transport.Udp, Null)}), "tcp-val": Variant(Transport.Tcp, Null), "udp-val": Variant(Transport.Udp, Null)})
